  "prefLabel": "Ac 102.03 Certified Public Accountant (CPA)",
  "priorExpiration": "2007-07-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 102.03 “Certified Public Accountant (CPA)” means a person holding a current certificate issued under RSA 309-B:5, or a person holding an equivalent accounting license issued in any jurisdiction in the United States.\n\nSource. #1663, eff 12-17-80; ss by #2475, eff 9-13-83; ss by #3061, eff 7-18-85, EXPIRED: 7-18-91\n\nNew. #5365, eff 3-27-92; ss by #6721, INTERIM, eff 3-27-98, EXPIRED: 7-25-98\n\nNew. #6901, eff 12-4-98; ss by #8810, INTERIM, eff 1-25-07, EXPIRED: 7-25-07\n\nNew. #9032, eff 11-21-07; ss by #10053, eff 1-1-12 (from Ac 101.01)",
